    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal Tape: KARAK</strong> is a psychological horror game set on a haunted Malaysian highway.<br>Trapped inside a car, you must manage the environment\u2014temperature, visibility, and mysterious events\u2014to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The temperature is rapidly dropping.<br>A bloodstained handprint appears on your window.<br>Something is outside... watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay calm. Keep the car safe.<br>Solve the mystery behind the paranormal disturbance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember\u2014<br>You are not alone tonight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Atmospheric sound design with fully immersive car interior experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Manage temperature, airflow, lights, and more to stay alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b Unpredictable paranormal events tied to your decisions</p></li></ul>",
